        "twitter_handle": null,
        "display_name": null,
        "comment": "Lure ZIP (4.3 MB) served from MediaFire hxxps://www.mediafire[.]com/file/r4xs0w0g7yrxtep/file via a gated PT/ES phishing chain (email -\u003e share.google short link -\u003e asniqdkw[.]com -\u003e bsadbnqwic[.]com fake Adobe Acrobat page). Contains one junk-padded VBS (sha256 8c43672d...b615f) plus decoy xml/pdf files. The VBS drops an 85.6 MB Delphi EXE that is a new-2026-build Grandoreiro loader: decrypts 399 strings statically, C2 guild[.]hopto[.]me (No-IP) resolved through dns.google DoH, port derived from SHA-256 of the resolved IP (3.80.57[.]117 -\u003e 9136), RC4 key 7684223510 + ZipForge. Static analysis only, nothing executed, C2 never contacted. IOCs and YARA: github.com/harperjohnsai/detections. Full walkthrough: youtube.com/@HarperJohnsAI. -- Harper Johns\n"
      }
    ],
